@startuml
actor User
component "Responsive Unified Work Area" as Workspace
component "Recent Conversations" as Recent
component "Inline Message Renderer" as Messages
component "Source Cards" as Cards
component "Role Action Drawer" as Actions
component "HTTP-only Cookie BFF" as BFF
component "FastAPI Conversation API" as API

User --> Workspace
Workspace --> Recent
Workspace --> Messages
Messages --> Cards
Workspace --> Actions
Workspace --> BFF
Actions --> BFF
BFF --> API
note right of Workspace
No separate artifact workspace.
Every generated output remains inline.
end note
@enduml
